  "description": "**Temporary collection for the transition to the EOPF Sentinel Zarr Samples Service's GeoZarr.**\n\nThe EOPF Explorer no longer converts Sentinel-2 L2A products itself. New scenes are published here instead: each item points at the GeoZarr (Zarr v3) store that the EOPF Sentinel Zarr Samples Service hosts on data.eodc.eu, and the Explorer copies and converts nothing. The items are registered from the Samples Service collection `sentinel-2-l2a-zarr3` (https://stac.core.eopf.eodc.eu/collections/sentinel-2-l2a-zarr3), in the Explorer's asset layout and with Explorer visualization links.\n\nThe scenes the Explorer converted itself, up to 30 September 2026, stay in `sentinel-2-l2a`. The scenes of about the last day before the switch are in both collections. This collection exists only for the transition: once it is complete, the EOPF Sentinel Zarr Samples Service will maintain the final catalogue and this collection will be retired.\n\nThe Sentinel-2 Level-2A Collection 1 product provides orthorectified Surface Reflectance (Bottom-Of-Atmosphere: BOA), with sub-pixel multispectral and multitemporal registration accuracy. Scene Classification (including Clouds and Cloud Shadows), AOT (Aerosol Optical Thickness) and WV (Water Vapour) maps are included in the product.",
